+/* D4-F · THE ANATOMY DECLARES THE TILE. The item's `#media` and `#meta` rows are the
+ * only thing that makes a group a set of tiles; nothing is declared. These cases pin
+ * the DOM half (the library-marked rows; the engine's attributes over a consumer's)
